{
  "_meta": {
    "description": "Canonical controlled vocabulary for Bollywood taste/theme analysis. Derived from cross-platform research (Netflix story-attribute tagging, Prime mood detection, academic film-mood work) and tuned for Indian cinema. The enrichment pipeline (scripts/enrich-plots.js) constrains Claude to these tags so they align across films; the taste engine (web/lib/taste.js) scores user affinity against them.",
    "version": 2,
    "conventions": "All tags are lowercase kebab-case. Enrichment should pick ONLY from these lists, except `themes` and `setting_tags` which allow a small number of free-form additions when nothing fits. `tone`, `comedy_style`, and `notable_elements` are strictly closed sets."
  },

